Stubbed macro date-like value stays a string.

-- fixtures/xdg/booping/config.yaml --
macro_stubs:
  core.macros.timestamp: "2024-01-01T12:00:00Z"
-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Test Plan
build_time: "{{ macro('core.macros.timestamp') }}"
---

# Test Plan Content

This is a test plan.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md build_time="{{ macro('core.macros.timestamp') }}"
-- exit --
0
